{"version":1,"content":"<p>2023年港姐季軍王敏慈憑標致樣貌，獲封「翻版范冰冰」，當選後她未有留港發展，而是到北京中央戲劇學院繼續學業，她未畢業已有機會參與內地紅星楊洋與章若楠主演的古裝劇《雨霖鈴》作為實習，早前她終於畢業，雖然初出茅廬，但已工作不斷。</p><p>她昨日（14日</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T07:16:47.911653+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T07:01:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T07:10:35.818892+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T07:10:35.818892+00:00","content_hash":"58c6de21a09204460914e2a528190aff8a9c5fec6f6cb6cfe01f557bf3d39341","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}